# Provenance

This directory is a verbatim copy of the LibSass 3.6.4 source as bundled by
the sassc-ruby gem (sassc 2.4.0, ext/libsass), the LibSass version the Ruby
oracle's stylesheet compilation uses. It is vendored so the scenario battery
can build its own LibSass compiler on a clean checkout (see
../build-native.mjs). `LICENSE` is LibSass's own MIT license text, taken from
the upstream repository (github.com/sass/libsass, tag 3.6.4). VERSION records
the exact source version. No file in this directory is modified from the
bundled source.
